    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0592","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Xochitl Whitehorse talks about painting the colour of a Tuesday. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
